%% AI-LOS assistive loop
sequenceDiagram
  participant LOS as BillionTechLOS
  participant AI as AI-LOS
  participant HUM as Analyst

  LOS->>LOS: FactSnapshot created
  LOS->>AI: POST analysis request refs + consent
  AI-->>LOS: AI outputs envelope
  LOS->>HUM: Review queue
  HUM->>LOS: accept FACT_CANDIDATE
  LOS->>LOS: AI_ACCEPTED fact + new snapshot
  Note over LOS: Policy Engine never sees AI_CANDIDATE as VERIFIED
  HUM->>LOS: Human Decision approve
  LOS->>LOS: Decision + Sanction
